{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a new threat to the galaxy emerges, Union Command dispatches a ragtag team of pilots and scientists. Join Captain Heathcliff and his Patchworks crew as they search for the solution within ancient Relic Suits in a tale of friendship and belonging.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>STORY</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead the Patchworks crew through 45 episodes of their thrilling space adventure. Uncover the mysteries of the Relic Suits as you get to know your endearing team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>BATTLE</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command a wide array of mecha pilots in card combat. Pair pilots with energy-generating Drones and potent Command Cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>CREW</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit and bond with pilots from five powerful factions. Outfit their Suits with transformative mods and amplify their unique abilities.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enjoy fully-voiced dialogue!</strong> Every one of the 75 characters is brought to life by the amazing voice cast.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hum along to the soundtrack! </strong>Over 40 spectacular tracks by composer Carlos &quot;insaneintherain&quot; Eiene guide you through combat and camaraderie.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategize to dominate! </strong>Lane-based attack patterns and special card passives create a deep system that's easy to learn.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tackle hand-crafted scenarios! </strong>Battles are woven into their episode's narrative. Prepare for ambushes, heists, Starball matches, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Power up your Suits and ship!</strong> Dozens of mods let you supercharge your strategies to win the way you want to.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Strawbeary Delights","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2870530/2603a4be5154e4de3a183533509921e5775ed44f.jpg"},{"name":"Thicker Than Water","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2870530/58f71222886304153e630f602dda1127d5948b40.jpg"},{"name":"Rockstar","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2870530/f08a41a4f33aa2d87f242fa89d18791443cb2ecd.jpg"},{"name":"All That Glitters","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2870530/ba54056b0805cbc4b8afdee486b74c721543045c.jpg"},{"name":"Lost Souls","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2870530/7ee9211ee3b6bc4fb0034e0698762b9b7e2f88cd.jpg"},{"name":"Tourist Trap","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2870530/0a4fd085e509a21e7a1efccc7d6e81d4af2cc29f.jpg"},{"name":"Safe Haven","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2870530/95836c5857ef2a38f73af6f1f529d2fed5788848.jpg"},{"name":"Everchanging","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2870530/bdb736a569ed0d16ff39bfcb90f2f216c59c1a42.jpg"},{"name":"Flying Colors","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2870530/2bcf94e2e27f5f8e5f0fe1c75e05aa5cd8eb6f6a.jpg"},{"name":"You've Got a Friend in Me","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2870530/bd983fdff181bbda174f8bc9a3f9ea403a0dbcfd.jpg"}],"total":32},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2870530?t=1773155674","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870530/4e9dcc24ab4f8b5e1a6b93fab4aadf3264b7f3ec/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773155674","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870530/d